  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Civic Participation</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="PT">Participa&#xe7;&#xe3;o C&#xed;vica</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="PT">Fortalecer o ambiente legal, regulat&#xf3;rio, institucional e de informa&#xe7;&#xe3;o que protege e permite o crescimento da vida associativa e o desenvolvimento de organiza&#xe7;&#xf5;es da sociedade civil (OSC) independentes e sustent&#xe1;veis.  Desenvolver a capacidade das organiza&#xe7;&#xf5;es da sociedade civil para actuarem como agentes de reforma e apoiarem a sua participa&#xe7;&#xe3;o na tomada de decis&#xf5;es democr&#xe1;ticas atrav&#xe9;s da articula&#xe7;&#xe3;o e representa&#xe7;&#xe3;o dos interesses dos seus membros, do envolvimento na presta&#xe7;&#xe3;o de servi&#xe7;os e da defesa de quest&#xf5;es que se tornem parte da agenda p&#xfa;blica e sejam reflectidas nas pol&#xed;ticas p&#xfa;blicas. Incentivar o fortalecimento de uma cultura c&#xed;vica que apoie institui&#xe7;&#xf5;es e processos democr&#xe1;ticos, a participa&#xe7;&#xe3;o ativa na vida pol&#xed;tica e c&#xed;vica e as virtudes c&#xed;vicas da toler&#xe2;ncia, do pluralismo, do compromisso, da confian&#xe7;a e do respeito pelos direitos individuais, incluindo a igualdade de g&#xe9;nero.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthen the legal, regulatory, institutional, and information environment which protects and enables the growth in associational life and the development of independent and sustainable civil society organizations (CSOs).  Build the capacity of civil society organizations to act as agents for reform and support their participation in democratic decision-making through articulating and representing their members interests, engaging in service delivery, and advocating for issues which become part of the public agenda and are reflected in public policies. Encourage the strengthening of a civic culture which supports democratic institutions and processes, active participation in political and civic life, and the civic virtues of tolerance, pluralism, compromise, trust, and respect for individual rights, including gender equality.</narrative>
  </description>
